"The Primary campaigns to reopen the way to a chaos-stricken place sealed off before Earth was found."
"The Primary is away from the Mother for long stretches; others have gone ahead of him."
"Knights Esh-erdi and Lind-otta are to join the campaign within about a year."
"The Sdyelis Branch, a huge oasis ship built in the forest near Vethedya, is being made for it."
"It is built entirely from materials native to the Mother, with minimal traveler's knowledge."
"It is meant to carry a piece of the planet anywhere, easing magic and giving a haven for rest."
"A Rapport III wizard designed it as her life's devotion; she and her children run the project."
